# Quality Gates — SSOT

> Single source of truth for quality thresholds across test levels. Refer from rules via: `@quality-gates#unit`, `@quality-gates#integration`, `@quality-gates#e2e`.

## 🔢 Score Scale
```yaml
score_scale:
  description: "10-point quality score"
  thresholds:
    production_ready: ">= 8.5"
    needs_improvement: "6.0–8.4"
    poor: "< 6.0"
```

## ⏱ Runtime Ceilings
```yaml
runtime:
  unit: "< 60s"
  integration: "< 5m"
  e2e: "< 30m"
```

## 🌪 Flakiness Budget
```yaml
flakiness_budget:
  unit: "~0% (not allowed)"
  integration: "< 2%"
  e2e: "< 5%"
  retry_policy:
    default_retries: 1
    disable_parallel_on_exceed: true
```

## ✅ Gate Definitions (общие)
```yaml
gates:
  gate1_existence: "Tests exist and run"
  gate2_passing: "0 failing, syntax and environment OK"
  gate3_validation: "NO_FALSE_SUCCESSES, VALIDATE_REAL_FUNCTIONALITY, NO_UNTESTED_CRITICAL_PATHS, CORRECT_LOGIC, MINIMAL_MOCK_OVERUSE"
  gate4_strategic: "ROI analysis and right test level"
```

---

## #unit
```yaml
level: unit
coverage:
  lines_critical: ">= 80%"
  branches_critical: ">= 70%"
critical_coverage: ">= 85% on critical paths"
runtime: "< 60s"
real_tests_ratio: ">= 60%"
score: ">= 8.5/10"
gates: [gate1_existence, gate2_passing, gate3_validation, gate4_strategic]
notes:
  - "Mock external systems only"
  - "Validate real behavior, not side effects"
```

## #integration
```yaml
level: integration
contract_coverage: ">= 80% of critical module boundaries"
flow_coverage: ">= 70% of critical flows"
runtime: "< 5m"
score: ">= 8.5/10"
gates: [gate1_existence, gate2_passing, gate3_validation, gate4_strategic]
notes:
  - "Use real modules; mock only external systems"
  - "Focus on module contracts and multi-step flows"
```

## #e2e
```yaml
level: e2e
workflow_coverage: ">= 70% of critical user journeys"
infrastructure: "Real node/infrastructure, snapshot-based isolation"
runtime: "< 30m"
flakiness: "< 5%"
score: ">= 8.5/10"
gates: [gate1_existence, gate2_passing, gate3_validation, gate4_strategic]
notes:
  - "Critical scenarios only (selective coverage)"
  - "Use snapshots aggressively"
```

---

## 🔗 Mapping to Rules
```yaml
mapping:
  unit: "@unit-test-build.mdc → use @quality-gates#unit"
  integration: "@integration-test-build.mdc → use @quality-gates#integration"
  e2e: "@e2e-test-build.mdc → use @quality-gates#e2e"
  qualification: "@test-qualification.mdc → evaluates against this SSOT"
```

